      {"start": 14.481, "end": 15.041, "text": "inherently"},
      {"start": 15.041, "end": 16.161, "text": "flexible."}
    ]},
    {"start": 16.161, "end": 27.121, "text": "As a result, this Court has consistently declined to inject judicially crafted bright line rules into a determination of whether a complaint's allegations plausibly allege imprudence.", "words": [
